# ENVIS Region VII does not require an environment file for the published build.
#
# The browser bundle ships only opaque account keys and salted PBKDF2-SHA256
# password hashes. No plaintext login names or passwords are read from the
# environment or committed to the repository.
#
# Keep local secrets in `.env.local` (ignored by git) if you add integrations
# that need them. Never commit `.env`, `.env.local`, `.npmrc` or CREDENTIALS.md.
